WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.181
You run a construction company. Three files today.

2
00:00:03.181 --> 00:00:07.655
A subcontractor claims forty-eight thousand three hundred fifty dollars in extras.

3
00:00:07.655 --> 00:00:13.327
The agents read fourteen emails, the purchase order, the directives, the site report and Procore.

4
00:00:13.327 --> 00:00:21.864
Eleven thousand two hundred already paid on claim six. Three stairwells, not five. Twenty-five thousand nine hundred fifty, no written directive.

5
00:00:21.864 --> 00:00:26.924
The draft is ready. Three judges validate it, one reservation visible. You decide.

6
00:00:26.924 --> 00:00:32.236
Client progress claim nine: four hundred twelve thousand six hundred dollars, due Friday.

7
00:00:32.236 --> 00:00:37.664
They cross-check the schedule, the surveyor, two hundred twelve photos, QuickBooks and the architect.

8
00:00:37.664 --> 00:00:44.209
Tile billed at a hundred percent, installed at sixty-two. Electrical read backwards. Accessories never delivered.

9
00:00:44.209 --> 00:00:49.884
Three hundred forty-eight thousand nine hundred, not four hundred twelve thousand six hundred. You decide.

10
00:00:49.884 --> 00:00:55.585
Ninety-two invoices past sixty days. Six hundred sixty-one thousand dollars that look unpaid.

11
00:00:55.585 --> 00:00:59.864
They reconcile QuickBooks, two bank statements and the lender's disbursements.

12
00:00:59.864 --> 00:01:05.655
Thirty-eight already paid by the lender, never recorded. Three duplicates. One back-dated invoice.

13
00:01:05.655 --> 00:01:09.205
Forty-one entries are ready. Not one is written without your GO.

14
00:01:09.205 --> 00:01:14.205
Nothing goes out, nothing gets paid without your GO.

